# Build-context filter for the repo root: deploy/image/Dockerfile (the published image, docs/DEPLOY.md),
# the sandbox/Dockerfile.test context and sandbox/Dockerfile's named context switchboard-src
# (docs/SANDBOX.md). An allowlist:
# only what the build and the test suite need goes in, so gitignored local files
# (logs, databases, target/, node_modules/, .env files) never reach an image.
*
!src/
!tests/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!sandbox/run-tests.sh
# the published image's `switchboard` (deploy/image/Dockerfile)
!deploy/image/switchboard.sh
# ...and, inside those, nothing local (mirrors .gitignore)
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/logs
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/.switchboard*
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
tests/live/_runs
